            <a href="/documents/practice_notes/SUG-RegistryConfirmationForm.pdf" target="_blank">Sugar Terminals Registry Confirmation Form</a> | <a href="/documents/practice_notes/STL-MemberStatusDeclaration(Growers).pdf" target="_blank">Sugar Terminals Member Status Declaration Form</a></td>
